<title>USA: Zycad Nasdaq listing to continue.</title>
<headline>Zycad Nasdaq listing to continue.</headline>
<dateline>FREMONT, Calif. 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zycad Corp said Monday it had received written notification from the Nasdaq stock market that it has complied with listing qualifications and will continue to be listed on Nasdaq.</p>
<p>The company said the 45-day period for review of this determination has expired with no review by the Nasdaq review committee.</p>
